{"seq":2,"slug":"room-database","title":"Room 数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/architecture-components/room-database","wordCount":514,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"room-数据库\">Room 数据库</h1><p>Room 是 Android Jetpack 提供的 SQLite 抽象层，通过注解处理器在编译时验证 SQL 语句，提供类型安全的数据库访问。它支持 Kotlin 协程和 Flow，与现代 Android 架构完美集成。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Room 围绕三个核心概念组织：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Entity / DAO / Database 三层</strong>：<code>@Entity</code> 映射表结构，<code>@Dao</code> 定义操作接口（Room 在编译时生成实现并校验 SQL），<code>@Database</code> 组装整体。</li>\n<li><strong>类型安全与 Flow 通知</strong>：编译时验证 SQL 消除运行时错误；返回 <code>Flow&lt;T&gt;</code> 的查询会在数据变化时自动发射新值，天然接入响应式架构。</li>\n<li><strong>迁移策略</strong>：结构变更必须提供迁移以保护用户数据，可选手写 <code>Migration</code> 或使用 Room 2.4+ 的 <code>AutoMigration</code>；复杂类型由 TypeConverter 负责序列化。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实体-entities\">实体（Entities）</h2><p>实体类映射数据库表，使用注解定义表结构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Entity(tableName = &quot;articles&quot;)&#10;data class ArticleEntity(&#10;    @PrimaryKey&#10;    val id: String,&#10;    @ColumnInfo(name = &quot;title&quot;)&#10;    val title: String,&#10;    @ColumnInfo(name = &quot;content&quot;)&#10;    val content: String,&#10;    @ColumnInfo(name = &quot;author_id&quot;)&#10;    val authorId: String,&#10;    @ColumnInfo(name = &quot;created_at&quot;)&#10;    val createdAt: Long,&#10;    @ColumnInfo(name = &quot;is_bookmarked&quot;)&#10;    val isBookmarked: Boolean = false,&#10;    @ColumnInfo(name = &quot;tags&quot;)&#10;    val tags: List&lt;String&gt; = emptyList()&#10;)&#10;&#10;@Entity(&#10;    tableName = &quot;comments&quot;,&#10;    foreignKeys = [&#10;        ForeignKey(&#10;            entity = ArticleEntity::class,&#10;            parentColumns = [&quot;id&quot;],&#10;            childColumns = [&quot;article_id&quot;],&#10;            onDelete = ForeignKey.CASCADE&#10;        )&#10;    ],&#10;    indices = [Index(&quot;article_id&quot;)]&#10;)&#10;data class CommentEntity(&#10;    @PrimaryKey(autoGenerate = true)&#10;    val id: Long = 0,&#10;    @ColumnInfo(name = &quot;article_id&quot;)&#10;    val articleId: String,&#10;    val text: String,&#10;    val author: String,&#10;    val timestamp: Long&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Entity(tableName = \"articles\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class ArticleEntity(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @PrimaryKey</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val id: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ColumnInfo(name = \"title\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val title: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ColumnInfo(name = \"content\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val content: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ColumnInfo(name = \"author_id\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val authorId: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ColumnInfo(name = \"created_at\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val createdAt: Long,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ColumnInfo(name = \"is_bookmarked\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val isBookmarked: Boolean = false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ColumnInfo(name = \"tags\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val tags: List&#x3C;String> = emptyList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Entity(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tableName = \"comments\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    foreignKeys = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ForeignKey(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            entity = ArticleEntity::class,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            parentColumns = [\"id\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            childColumns = [\"article_id\"],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onDelete = ForeignKey.CASCADE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    indices = [Index(\"article_id\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class CommentEntity(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @PrimaryKey(autoGenerate = true)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val id: Long = 0,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ColumnInfo(name = \"article_id\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val articleId: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val text: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val author: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val timestamp: Long</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"erDiagram\" data-source=\"erDiagram&#10;    ARTICLES {&#10;        string id PK&#10;        string title&#10;        string content&#10;        string author_id&#10;        long created_at&#10;        boolean is_bookmarked&#10;        string tags&#10;    }&#10;    COMMENTS {&#10;        long id PK&#10;        string article_id FK&#10;        string text&#10;        string author&#10;        long timestamp&#10;    }&#10;    ARTICLES ||--o{ COMMENTS : &quot;has many&quot;\">erDiagram\n    ARTICLES {\n        string id PK\n        string title\n        string content\n        string author_id\n        long created_at\n        boolean is_bookmarked\n        string tags\n    }\n    COMMENTS {\n        long id PK\n        string article_id FK\n        string text\n        string author\n        long timestamp\n    }\n    ARTICLES ||--o{ COMMENTS : \"has many\"</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"dao-数据访问对象\">DAO（数据访问对象）</h2><p>DAO 定义数据库操作接口，Room 在编译时生成实现。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Dao&#10;interface ArticleDao {&#10;&#10;    @Query(&quot;SELECT * FROM articles ORDER BY created_at DESC&quot;)&#10;    fun getAllArticles(): Flow&lt;List&lt;ArticleEntity&gt;&gt;&#10;&#10;    @Query(&quot;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE id = :id&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun getArticleById(id: String): ArticleEntity?&#10;&#10;    @Query(&quot;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE is_bookmarked = 1 ORDER BY created_at DESC&quot;)&#10;    fun getBookmarkedArticles(): Flow&lt;List&lt;ArticleEntity&gt;&gt;&#10;&#10;    @Query(&quot;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE title LIKE &#39;%&#39; || :query || &#39;%&#39; OR content LIKE &#39;%&#39; || :query || &#39;%&#39;&quot;)&#10;    fun searchArticles(query: String): Flow&lt;List&lt;ArticleEntity&gt;&gt;&#10;&#10;    @Insert(onConflict = OnConflictStrategy.REPLACE)&#10;    suspend fun insertArticles(articles: List&lt;ArticleEntity&gt;)&#10;&#10;    @Update&#10;    suspend fun updateArticle(article: ArticleEntity)&#10;&#10;    @Query(&quot;UPDATE articles SET is_bookmarked = :bookmarked WHERE id = :id&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun setBookmarked(id: String, bookmarked: Boolean)&#10;&#10;    @Delete&#10;    suspend fun deleteArticle(article: ArticleEntity)&#10;&#10;    @Query(&quot;DELETE FROM articles&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun deleteAllArticles()&#10;&#10;    @Transaction&#10;    @Query(&quot;SELECT * FROM articles WHERE id = :id&quot;)&#10;    fun getArticleWithComments(id: String): Flow&lt;ArticleWithComments&gt;&#10;}&#10;&#10;data class ArticleWithComments(&#10;    @Embedded val article: ArticleEntity,&#10;    @Relation(&#10;        parentColumn = &quot;id&quot;,&#10;        entityColumn = &quot;article_id&quot;&#10;    )&#10;    val comments: List&lt;CommentEntity&gt;&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Dao</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface ArticleDao {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"SELECT * FROM articles ORDER BY created_at DESC\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getAllArticles(): Flow&#x3C;List&#x3C;ArticleEntity>></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"SELECT * FROM articles WHERE id = :id\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun getArticleById(id: String): ArticleEntity?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"SELECT * FROM articles WHERE is_bookmarked = 1 ORDER BY created_at DESC\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getBookmarkedArticles(): Flow&#x3C;List&#x3C;ArticleEntity>></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"SELECT * FROM articles WHERE title LIKE '%' || :query || '%' OR content LIKE '%' || :query || '%'\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun searchArticles(query: String): Flow&#x3C;List&#x3C;ArticleEntity>></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Insert(onConflict = OnConflictStrategy.REPLACE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun insertArticles(articles: List&#x3C;ArticleEntity>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Update</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun updateArticle(article: ArticleEntity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"UPDATE articles SET is_bookmarked = :bookmarked WHERE id = :id\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun setBookmarked(id: String, bookmarked: Boolean)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Delete</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun deleteArticle(article: ArticleEntity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"DELETE FROM articles\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun deleteAllArticles()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Transaction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"SELECT * FROM articles WHERE id = :id\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getArticleWithComments(id: String): Flow&#x3C;ArticleWithComments></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class ArticleWithComments(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Embedded val article: ArticleEntity,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Relation(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        parentColumn = \"id\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        entityColumn = \"article_id\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val comments: List&#x3C;CommentEntity></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>注解</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>返回类型建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@Query</code></td>\n<td>自定义 SQL 查询</td>\n<td><code>Flow&lt;T&gt;</code> / <code>suspend fun</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Insert</code></td>\n<td>插入数据</td>\n<td><code>suspend fun</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Update</code></td>\n<td>更新数据</td>\n<td><code>suspend fun</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Delete</code></td>\n<td>删除数据</td>\n<td><code>suspend fun</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Transaction</code></td>\n<td>事务操作</td>\n<td>关联查询必须使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@Upsert</code></td>\n<td>插入或更新</td>\n<td><code>suspend fun</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"类型转换器\">类型转换器</h2><p>Room 默认只支持基本类型，复杂类型需要通过 TypeConverter 转换。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class Converters {&#10;&#10;    @TypeConverter&#10;    fun fromStringList(value: List&lt;String&gt;): String {&#10;        return Json.encodeToString(value)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @TypeConverter&#10;    fun toStringList(value: String): List&lt;String&gt; {&#10;        return Json.decodeFromString(value)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @TypeConverter&#10;    fun fromInstant(value: Instant?): Long? {&#10;        return value?.toEpochMilliseconds()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @TypeConverter&#10;    fun toInstant(value: Long?): Instant? {&#10;        return value?.let { Instant.fromEpochMilliseconds(it) }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Database(&#10;    entities = [ArticleEntity::class, CommentEntity::class],&#10;    version = 2,&#10;    exportSchema = true&#10;)&#10;@TypeConverters(Converters::class)&#10;abstract class AppDatabase : RoomDatabase() {&#10;    abstract fun articleDao(): ArticleDao&#10;    abstract fun commentDao(): CommentDao&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class Converters {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @TypeConverter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun fromStringList(value: List&#x3C;String>): String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Json.encodeToString(value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @TypeConverter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun toStringList(value: String): List&#x3C;String> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Json.decodeFromString(value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @TypeConverter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun fromInstant(value: Instant?): Long? {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return value?.toEpochMilliseconds()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @TypeConverter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun toInstant(value: Long?): Instant? {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return value?.let { Instant.fromEpochMilliseconds(it) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Database(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    entities = [ArticleEntity::class, CommentEntity::class],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    version = 2,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    exportSchema = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@TypeConverters(Converters::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract class AppDatabase : RoomDatabase() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abstract fun articleDao(): ArticleDao</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abstract fun commentDao(): CommentDao</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 设置 <code>exportSchema = true</code> 可以导出数据库的 JSON 格式 schema，用于自动化迁移验证。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"数据库迁移\">数据库迁移</h2><p>当数据库结构发生变化时，必须提供迁移策略以保护用户数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"val MIGRATION_1_2 = object : Migration(1, 2) {&#10;    override fun migrate(db: SupportSQLiteDatabase) {&#10;        db.execSQL(&quot;ALTER TABLE articles ADD COLUMN tags TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;[]&#39;&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;val MIGRATION_2_3 = object : Migration(2, 3) {&#10;    override fun migrate(db: SupportSQLiteDatabase) {&#10;        db.execSQL(&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;            CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS comments (&#10;                id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT NOT NULL,&#10;                article_id TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;                text TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;                author TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;                timestamp INTEGER NOT NULL,&#10;                FOREIGN KEY (article_id) REFERENCES articles(id) ON DELETE CASCADE&#10;            )&#10;        &quot;&quot;&quot;)&#10;        db.execSQL(&quot;CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS index_comments_article_id ON comments(article_id)&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Module&#10;@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;object DatabaseModule {&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideDatabase(@ApplicationContext context: Context): AppDatabase {&#10;        return Room.databaseBuilder(context, AppDatabase::class.java, &quot;app_database&quot;)&#10;            .addMigrations(MIGRATION_1_2, MIGRATION_2_3)&#10;            .build()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    fun provideArticleDao(database: AppDatabase): ArticleDao = database.articleDao()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>val MIGRATION_1_2 = object : Migration(1, 2) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun migrate(db: SupportSQLiteDatabase) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        db.execSQL(\"ALTER TABLE articles ADD COLUMN tags TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '[]'\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val MIGRATION_2_3 = object : Migration(2, 3) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun migrate(db: SupportSQLiteDatabase) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        db.execSQL(\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS comments (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT NOT NULL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                article_id TEXT NOT NULL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                text TEXT NOT NULL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                author TEXT NOT NULL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                timestamp INTEGER NOT NULL,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                FOREIGN KEY (article_id) REFERENCES articles(id) ON DELETE CASCADE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"\"\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        db.execSQL(\"CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS index_comments_article_id ON comments(article_id)\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object DatabaseModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideDatabase(@ApplicationContext context: Context): AppDatabase {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Room.databaseBuilder(context, AppDatabase::class.java, \"app_database\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .addMigrations(MIGRATION_1_2, MIGRATION_2_3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideArticleDao(database: AppDatabase): ArticleDao = database.articleDao()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Version 1] --&gt;|MIGRATION_1_2| B[Version 2]&#10;    B --&gt;|MIGRATION_2_3| C[Version 3]&#10;    A --&gt;|自动迁移| C&#10;&#10;    classDef versionStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A,B,C versionStyle\">graph LR\n    A[Version 1] --&gt;|MIGRATION_1_2| B[Version 2]\n    B --&gt;|MIGRATION_2_3| C[Version 3]\n    A --&gt;|自动迁移| C\n\n    classDef versionStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A,B,C versionStyle</pre><p>Room 2.4+ 支持自动迁移：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Database(&#10;    entities = [ArticleEntity::class],&#10;    version = 3,&#10;    autoMigrations = [&#10;        AutoMigration(from = 1, to = 2),&#10;        AutoMigration(from = 2, to = 3, spec = Migration2To3::class)&#10;    ]&#10;)&#10;abstract class AppDatabase : RoomDatabase()&#10;&#10;@RenameColumn(tableName = &quot;articles&quot;, fromColumnName = &quot;desc&quot;, toColumnName = &quot;content&quot;)&#10;class Migration2To3 : AutoMigrationSpec\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Database(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    entities = [ArticleEntity::class],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    version = 3,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    autoMigrations = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AutoMigration(from = 1, to = 2),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        AutoMigration(from = 2, to = 3, spec = Migration2To3::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract class AppDatabase : RoomDatabase()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@RenameColumn(tableName = \"articles\", fromColumnName = \"desc\", toColumnName = \"content\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Migration2To3 : AutoMigrationSpec</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"flow-livedata-支持与测试\">Flow / LiveData 支持与测试</h2><p>Room 的 Flow 返回类型会在数据变化时自动发射新值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class ArticleRepository(private val articleDao: ArticleDao) {&#10;&#10;    fun getArticles(): Flow&lt;List&lt;Article&gt;&gt; =&#10;        articleDao.getAllArticles().map { entities -&gt;&#10;            entities.map { it.toDomain() }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;    suspend fun toggleBookmark(id: String) {&#10;        val article = articleDao.getArticleById(id) ?: return&#10;        articleDao.setBookmarked(id, !article.isBookmarked)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)&#10;class ArticleDaoTest {&#10;&#10;    private lateinit var database: AppDatabase&#10;    private lateinit var dao: ArticleDao&#10;&#10;    @Before&#10;    fun setup() {&#10;        database = Room.inMemoryDatabaseBuilder(&#10;            ApplicationProvider.getApplicationContext(),&#10;            AppDatabase::class.java&#10;        ).allowMainThreadQueries().build()&#10;        dao = database.articleDao()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @After&#10;    fun teardown() {&#10;        database.close()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Test&#10;    fun insertAndRetrieveArticle() = runTest {&#10;        val article = ArticleEntity(&#10;            id = &quot;1&quot;, title = &quot;测试&quot;, content = &quot;内容&quot;,&#10;            authorId = &quot;a1&quot;, createdAt = System.currentTimeMillis()&#10;        )&#10;        dao.insertArticles(listOf(article))&#10;&#10;        val result = dao.getAllArticles().first()&#10;        assertEquals(1, result.size)&#10;        assertEquals(&quot;测试&quot;, result[0].title)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class ArticleRepository(private val articleDao: ArticleDao) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun getArticles(): Flow&#x3C;List&#x3C;Article>> =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        articleDao.getAllArticles().map { entities -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            entities.map { it.toDomain() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun toggleBookmark(id: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val article = articleDao.getArticleById(id) ?: return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        articleDao.setBookmarked(id, !article.isBookmarked)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class ArticleDaoTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private lateinit var database: AppDatabase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private lateinit var dao: ArticleDao</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Before</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun setup() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        database = Room.inMemoryDatabaseBuilder(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ApplicationProvider.getApplicationContext(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            AppDatabase::class.java</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ).allowMainThreadQueries().build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        dao = database.articleDao()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @After</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun teardown() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        database.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun insertAndRetrieveArticle() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val article = ArticleEntity(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            id = \"1\", title = \"测试\", content = \"内容\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            authorId = \"a1\", createdAt = System.currentTimeMillis()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        dao.insertArticles(listOf(article))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val result = dao.getAllArticles().first()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(1, result.size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        assertEquals(\"测试\", result[0].title)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Room 通过注解处理器在编译时验证 SQL，提供类型安全的数据库访问</li>\n<li>Entity 定义表结构，DAO 定义操作接口，Database 组装整体</li>\n<li>TypeConverter 处理复杂类型的序列化与反序列化</li>\n<li>数据库迁移通过 <code>Migration</code> 类或 <code>AutoMigration</code> 注解实现</li>\n<li>Flow 返回类型实现数据变化的自动通知，使用内存数据库进行 DAO 测试</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Room 数据库","id":"room-数据库"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"实体（Entities）","id":"实体-entities"},{"level":2,"text":"DAO（数据访问对象）","id":"dao-数据访问对象"},{"level":2,"text":"类型转换器","id":"类型转换器"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库迁移","id":"数据库迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"Flow / LiveData 支持与测试","id":"flow-livedata-支持与测试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ViewModel 视图模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/architecture-components/viewmodel"},"next":{"title":"DataStore 数据存储","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/architecture-components/datastore"}}